  // ---- TEST A: a map in a widget of our own, 640x420, deliberately offset.
  // If the map draws here and nowhere else, it renders inside its widget and
  // the whole board idea is on. MapMini.layout already does this at 300x300,
  // so the odds are good -- this proves it for a widget WE made.
