  // ---- TEST B: the same shape again, this time inside an RTTextureWidget.
  // Nothing is drawn to the screen from here -- the render target only shows
  // once a material samples it -- so what this half proves on its own is
  // narrower: whether the map widget inside it lays out at all. PixelPerUnit
  // coming back <= 0 is the tell that it does not.
